# Clickjacking & Headers Reviewer Rule v2.1 STRICT

Invoke **`clickjacking_headers_reviewer`** -> `.cursor/agents/clickjacking_headers_reviewer.md`.

| Report line | `clickjacking_headers_reviewer v2.1 STRICT` |
| Fleet position line | `#12 — Phase 4 (Browser & transport)` |

## Non-negotiable rules

1. **Implicit Spring defaults do not pass when headers are customized.**
2. **JS-only frame busting without HTTP headers is FAIL (HDR04).**
3. **Unguarded `defaultsDisabled()` is FAIL (HDR09).**
4. **HSTS absent or max-age zero is FAIL (HDR07).**
5. **`unsafe-inline` / `unsafe-eval` in `script-src` is FAIL (HDR11).**
6. **`unsafe-inline` / `unsafe-eval` in `style-src` is FAIL (HDR15)** — strict `script-src` does not excuse weak `style-src`.
7. **Inline `style=` on Thymeleaf templates or UI JS HTML sinks is FAIL (HDR16)** unless nonce/hash style CSP is fully evidenced.


**Picture in your head (mandatory):** Every scored finding and Manual Review CHECK-ID explanation must include `#### Picture in your head`. See `SCORING_REVIEWER_AGENT_MECHANISM.md`.
